      "summary": {
        "en": "Inflicts one enemy with a \"Proof of Debt\" state and causes it to receive increased Follow-Up ATK DMG. Numby deals Fire DMG to the target.",
        "zh-CN": "使敌方单体陷入【负债证明】状态，受到的追加攻击伤害提高。账账对目标造成火属性伤害。"
      },
      "typeText": { "en": "Skill", "zh-CN": "战技" },
