    {
      "id": 111204,
      "type": "Talent",
      "name": { "en": "Trotter Market!?", "zh-CN": "猪市？！" },
      "description": {
        "en": "Summons Numby at the start of battle. Numby has #1[i] SPD by default. When taking action, Numby launches Follow-Up ATKs on one enemy target afflicted with \"Proof of Debt,\" dealing Fire DMG equal to #2[i]% of Topaz's ATK.\nWhen enemies afflicted with \"Proof of Debt\" receive an ally's Follow-Up ATKs, Numby's action is Advanced Forward by #3[i]%. The action Advance Forward effect cannot be triggered during Numby's own turn.\nWhen Topaz is downed, Numby disappears.",
        "zh-CN": "战斗开始时召唤账账。账账初始拥有#1[i]点速度，行动时发动追加攻击，对陷入【负债证明】状态下的敌方单体造成等同于托帕#2[i]%攻击力的火属性伤害。\n陷入【负债证明】状态下的敌方目标受到我方的追加攻击时，账账行动提前#3[i]%。在账账自身回合内，无法触发行动提前效果。\n当托帕陷入无法战斗状态时账账消失。"
      },
      "params": [
        [80, 0.75, 0.5],
        [80, 0.825, 0.5],
